  "answer": "```python\ndef merge_intervals(intervals):\n    if not intervals:\n        return []\n    sorted_intervals = sorted(intervals)\n    merged = [sorted_intervals[0]]\n    for start, end in sorted_intervals[1:]:\n        last_start, last_end = merged[-1]\n        if start <= last_end:\n            if end > last_end:\n                merged[-1] = (last_start, end)\n        else:\n            merged.append((start, end))\n    return merged\n```",
